# The FreeCAD document is a rebuild artefact of geometry/model_loop.py, and a
# binary one that diffs badly. The STEP export is committed instead: it is the
# thing a reviewer opens, and it is readable by every CAD tool rather than one.
models/*.FCStd
models/*.FCBak

# geometry.bin and manifest.json ARE committed, deliberately. They are
# regenerable by viewer/prepare_geometry.py, but committing them means a clone
# can open the viewer without running anything, and 0.55 MB is a fair price for
# that. Rebuild them whenever layout.py changes.
